        "Content": "•Beautiful, ground floor, 2 bedroom apartment.\n•Fully furnished\n•Spacious property with stunning views of the Arnold Palmer Designed Golf Course\n•Adjacent to the N7 and M4 and Dublin City is only 40 minutes away \n\nBeautiful and secure ground floor apartment situated on the grounds of The K-Club in one of Ireland`s most exclusive and desirable gated community developments located on 550 acre site. This spacious property with stunning views of the Arnold Palmer Designed Golf Course is fully furnished and available immediately.\n\nThe apartment is ideally located within the Ladycastle development, a highly prestigious residential development of apartments and detached homes on an eight acre site running alongside the Arnold Palmer Course and boasts stunning views that overlook the 18th fairway of the Palmer Course. The property consists of a fully equipped kitchen with all mod cons, guest w.c., large master double bedroom with bathroom en-suite, the second bedroom is also a double with en-suite. There is a large living-cum-dining room which leads onto a patio area with spectacular views the Arnold Palmer Designed Golf Course. \n\nConveniently located adjacent to the N7 and M4, with Dublin City only 40 minutes away and the lovely village of Straffan on the doorstep.\n\nAvailable immediately.\n\nEmail enquiries only please.\n"
      },
